# Persistent Marshstalker: "+1/+0 for each other Rat you control" (CR 613.4c). Alone it is its printed 3/1 (it is a Rat itself,
# but "other"); a first Typhoid Rats makes it 4/1, a second 5/1, and Bot2's own Typhoid Rats (an opponent's Rat) changes
# nothing. A Black Lotus and a Mox Jet pay for the Marshstalker and both Rats.

